Package: vnmap
Title: Map the Provinces and Municipalities of Viet Nam
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yuki", "Matsuura", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "matsuura.yuki.200095@gmail.com")
Description: Convenient 'ggplot2' choropleth maps of Viet Nam using either
    the 34 provincial-level administrative units effective from July 2025 or
    the preceding 63-unit geography. Includes name normalization, official
    administrative codes, and simple-feature boundary data. Boundaries are
    derived from the public-domain 'geoBoundaries' Viet Nam ADM1 data and the
    2025 units are constructed according to Decision 19/2025/QD-TTg.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    sf,
    stringi
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/ura8107/vnmap
